# chengdu — upstream pins
#
# Sourced by scripts/*.sh. Full-length (40-char) commit SHAs are the
# source of truth; short forms in comments are for human cross-reference
# against the PANDA Runbook §9 provenance appendix only.
#
# Verify: grep -E '^(PARSER|GROUNDER|ENGINE|PANDADEALER)_(URL|SHA)=' pins.env

# pandaPIparser — short: 88c0995
